<p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p>
<ol><li>Jano Dil Qurbaan Tujh Par Jan(a.s.)-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam<br>
Baazoo-e-Sibt(a.s.)-e-Payambar(s.a.w.w.) Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</li><p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p><li>Dast-e-Haider(a.s.) Aks-e-Haider(a.s.) Marzi-e-Shabbir(a.s.) Hai</li><p>Qalb-e-Zehra(s.a.) Ki Dua Hai Azm-e-Khaiber Geer(a.s.) Hai</p><p>Hai Akela Misl-e-Lashkar Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</p><p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p><li>Teray Baazo Zulfeqaar-e-Haidery(a.s.) Say Kam Nahin</li><p>Ghaiz Mein Aaen To Zarb-e-Haidery(a.s.) Say Kam Nahin</p><p>Saani-e-Zehra(s.a.) Ki Chadar Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</p><p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p><li>Tera Parcham Parcham-e-Islam Ban Kar Reh Gaya</li><p>Tera Baazoo Baazoo-e-Eeman Ban Kar Reh Gaya</p><p>Ibn-e-Mola(a.s.)-e-Abuzar(a.s.) Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</p><p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p><li>Teri Haibat Teri Jurrat Aur Yeh Tera Alam </li><p>Koi Khasakta Nahin Ab Bhi Teri Jhooti Qasam</p><p>Aey Bahadur Aur Safdar Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</p><p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p><li>Hai Dua-e-Zainabi(s.a.) Say Tu Alamdar-e-Wafa(a.s.)</li><p>Apna Beta(a.s.) Maanti Hain Khud Janab-e-Syeda(s.a.)</p><p>Waah Ray Teray Muqaddar Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</p><p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p><li>Tu Hai Quraan-e-Wafa Tafseer Hai Eesaar Ki</li><p>Moj Kay Seena Peh Tu Nay Dastaan Tehreer Ki</p><p>Mashk Mein Bharkay Samandar Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</p><p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p><li>Hashr Tak Dariya Peh Qabza Karbala Jageer Hai</li><p>Tu Hussaini(a.s.) Azm Kay Quraan Ki Tafseer Hai</p><p>Tera Dushman Hoga Abtar Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</p><p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p><li>Hogaey Baazo Qalam Jab Mashk Zakhmi Hogai</li></ol>

<p>Janib-e-Khaima Teri Janay Ki Himmat Naa Rahin</p>
<p>Haaey Abbas(a.s.)-e-Dilawar Jan-e-Haider(a.s.) Assalam</p>
<p>(Assalam Ghazi Meray Assalam) x2</p></font></p>
